OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam and Catherine visit Bute
OL,4,Aand King opens AI summit as row erupts
OL,5,Aover Diana book
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales are on
OL,8,Ftheir first official visit to Bute,
OL,9,FScotland, on what is a busy day for the
OL,10,Froyals
OL,12,FAs part of their trip, William and
OL,13,FCatherine watch and play shinty - our
OL,14,Freporter takes you through the
OL,15,Ftraditional sport
OL,17,FEarlier, while opening a summit in
OL,18,FAyrshire, the King warned of the
OL,19,F"existential dangers" of AI falling
OL,20,Finto the wrong hands
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
