OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam and Catherine visit Bute
OL,4,Aand King opens AI summit as row erupts
OL,5,Aover Diana book
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show the monarch speaking to
OL,8,Ftech figures, including Nvidia boss
OL,9,FJensen Huang
OL,11,FIn London, the Duke of Sussex is
OL,12,Fexpected at an Invictus Games event
OL,13,Flater - he and his wife, Meghan, moved
OL,14,Fback to the UK from the US last month
OL,15,Fand remain non-working royals
OL,17,FMeanwhile, a row has erupted between
OL,18,FBuckingham Palace and Earl Spencer,
OL,19,FPrincess Diana's brother, over claims
OL,20,Fhe makes about the King in a new memoir
